  dialogue: "I received a zip file labeled \u2018Payroll Update\u2019. But payroll
    never sends compressed files, do they?"
  firstChoice: "It\u2019s probably just a new format, open it."
  secondChoice: "If it\u2019s unusual, scan it before opening."
  firstChoiceResponse: "That doesn\u2019t sound right\u2026 better not risk it."
  secondChoiceResponse: Exactly. A quick scan could save the whole department.
